+"""Experiment 4954: backfill .456 runtime stamps and confirm relaxed mtime readiness.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-REPORT-4954, SCENARIO-REPORT-4954,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-4954-MTIME-WINDOW,
